==Portuguese==
{{wikipedia|lang=pt}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|pt|aoc|Roroimü}}, from {{m|aoc|rora||green, blue, [[grue]]}} + {{m|aoc|-imü|pos=augmentative suffix}}. Other suggested meanings include "{{l|en|cashew}} range" and "mother of winds".

===Pronunciation===
{{pt-IPA|br=Roráima,Rorâima}}
* {{audio|pt|Pt-br Roraima.ogg|Audio (BR)}}

The pronunciation with /ɐj/ is sometimes proscribed. In Roraima, /aj/ is much more common.

